      "html": "<figure class=\"ds-stat\"><figcaption class=\"ds-stat__label\">Valor agregado 2023</figcaption><p class=\"ds-stat__value\">$1,28 bill.<span class=\"ds-stat__unit\">pesos corrientes</span></p><p class=\"ds-stat__change ds-stat__change--fav\"><svg class=\"ds-stat__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7\"/></svg><span>+8,8 % frente a 2022</span><span class=\"ds-stat__verdict\">Favorable</span></p><p class=\"ds-stat__source\">Fuente: DANE (TerriData, DNP)</p></figure>",
